My recommendation

This is ambitious enough that I would treat it as the blueprint for a real company rather than a software project. I'd write it to the quality expected from a venture-backed enterprise AI startup, with clear assumptions, realistic business cases, detailed AI agent designs, and phased execution plans.

The key difference is that every section should be actionable for engineers, designers, sales teams, leadership, and potential investors—not just inspirational. If we build it that way, it becomes the foundation for everything that follows, from development to fundraising to enterprise sales.
